Hi Shiva,

Nothing of this should be necessary with the most recent versions of R, JGR, Deducer.
What versions are you currently working with.
I am an a Mac running 10.9.3 using R 3.1.0 for Mavericks, JGR 1.7-17, Deducer 0.7-7, rjava 0.9.6.
You may need to upgrade a few more dependencies as well.
The JGR.app is available from r-forge as JGR.dmg to be installed outside R. Then, I start deducer via the JGR.app by clicking on its icon, not from the R console.
This works well just as downloaded, no further manipulations required.

Rudolf

